#: ../../errors.md:1
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "Amaphutha"

#: ../../errors.md:3
msgid ""
"When a request fails, the response body always has the same shape, "
"whatever went wrong."
msgstr ""
"Uma isicelo sihluleka, umzimba wempendulo uhlala unesakhiwo esifanayo, "
"kungakhathaliseki ukuthi yini engahambanga kahle."

#: ../../errors.md ../../errors.md:15
msgid "`type`"
msgstr "`type`"

#: ../../errors.md:16
msgid "A machine readable category. Branch your code on this value."
msgstr "Isigaba esifundeka umshini. Sebenzisa leli nani ukuqondisa ikhodi yakho."

#: ../../errors.md:18
msgid "`message`"
msgstr "`message`"

#: ../../errors.md:19
msgid ""
"A plain explanation for humans. Show it in logs, but do not parse it. The"
" wording can change."
msgstr ""
"Incazelo elula yabantu. Yibonise kuma-log, kodwa ungayihlaziyi. Amagama "
"asetshenzisiwe angashintsha."

#: ../../errors.md:21
msgid "`request_id`"
msgstr "`request_id`"

#: ../../errors.md:22
msgid ""
"The ID of this request. It is also in the `X-Request-ID` response header."
" Quote it when you contact support, and never send your API key."
msgstr ""
"I-ID yalesi sicelo. Iphinde ibe ku-header yempendulo `X-Request-ID`. "
"Yisho lapho uxhumana nosekelo, futhi ungalokothi uthumele ukhiye wakho we-API."

#: ../../errors.md:24
msgid "Error types"
msgstr "Izinhlobo zamaphutha"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Isimo"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "What it means"
msgstr "Okukushoyo"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Retry?"
msgstr "Zama futhi?"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`authentication_required`"
msgstr "`authentication_required`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "401"
msgstr "401"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The `Authorization` header is missing or malformed."
msgstr "I-header `Authorization` ayikho noma yakheke ngendlela engalungile."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "Cha"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`invalid_api_key`"
msgstr "`invalid_api_key`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The key is not recognised."
msgstr "Ukhiye awubonwa."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`invalid_request`"
msgstr "`invalid_request`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "400"
msgstr "400"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "A field is missing or has a bad value. The message names the field."
msgstr "Inkambu ayikho noma inenani elingalungile. Umlayezo usho inkambu ethintekayo."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`unsupported_language`"
msgstr "`unsupported_language`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid ""
"The model does not support this language. The message lists the ones it "
"does."
msgstr ""
"Imodeli ayilusekeli lolu limi. Umlayezo ubala izilimi eyazisekelayo."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`unsupported_region`"
msgstr "`unsupported_region`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The region is not one of `ke`, `ug`, `ma` or `mu`."
msgstr "Isifunda asisona esinye se-`ke`, `ug`, `ma` noma `mu`."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`model_not_found`"
msgstr "`model_not_found`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "404"
msgstr "404"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "There is no model with that ID. List models with `GET /v1/models`."
msgstr "Ayikho imodeli enaleyo ID. Bhala amamodeli usebenzisa `GET /v1/models`."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`not_found`"
msgstr "`not_found`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "There is no endpoint at that path."
msgstr "Ayikho i-endpoint kuleyo ndlela."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`method_not_allowed`"
msgstr "`method_not_allowed`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "405"
msgstr "405"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The endpoint does not accept that HTTP method."
msgstr "I-endpoint ayiyamukeli leyo ndlela ye-HTTP."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`rate_limit_exceeded`"
msgstr "`rate_limit_exceeded`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "429"
msgstr "429"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "You used all your requests for this minute."
msgstr "Usebenzise zonke izicelo zakho zale minithi."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Yes, after `Retry-After`"
msgstr "Yebo, ngemva kwe-`Retry-After`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`internal_error`"
msgstr "`internal_error`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "500"
msgstr "500"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Something went wrong on the service side."
msgstr "Kukhona okungahambanga kahle ohlangothini lwesevisi."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Yes, with backoff"
msgstr "Yebo, ngokulinda isikhathi esikhulayo"

#: ../../errors.md:39
msgid ""
"A `400`, `401`, `404` or `405` means the request itself needs to change. "
"Sending it again unchanged will fail again."
msgstr ""
"I-`400`, `401`, `404` noma `405` isho ukuthi isicelo ngokwaso sidinga "
"ukushintshwa. Ukusithumela futhi singashintshiwe kuzophinde kwehluleke."

#: ../../errors.md:41
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Izibonelo"

#: ../../errors.md:43
msgid "A model that does not support the language you asked for:"
msgstr "Imodeli engalusekeli ulimi olucelile:"

#: ../../errors.md:55
msgid ""
"The fix is in the message. Use a model that supports the language, or "
"choose one of the listed languages."
msgstr ""
"Isixazululo sikhona emlayezweni. Sebenzisa imodeli esekela lolu limi, "
"noma ukhethe olunye lwezilimi ezibaliwe."

#: ../../errors.md:57
msgid "Rate limits"
msgstr "Imikhawulo yezinga"

#: ../../errors.md:59
msgid ""
"Each API key can make 10 requests per minute. The count resets at the "
"start of each minute. Every response tells you where you stand."
msgstr ""
"Ukhiye ngamunye we-API ungenza izicelo eziyi-10 ngomzuzu. Isibalo siqala "
"kabusha ekuqaleni komzuzu ngamunye. Impendulo ngayinye ikutshela ukuthi "
"usesiphi isimo."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Header"
msgstr "I-header"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Incazelo"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Requests allowed per minute."
msgstr "Izicelo ezivunyelwe ngomzuzu."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Requests left in the current minute."
msgstr "Izicelo ezisele kule minithi yamanje."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Seconds until the count resets."
msgstr "Amasekhondi kuze kuqale kabusha isibalo."

#: ../../errors.md:67
msgid ""
"When you use up your requests, the next one returns status `429` with a "
"`Retry-After` header."
msgstr ""
"Uma usebenzise zonke izicelo zakho, esilandelayo sibuyisa isimo `429` "
"ne-header `Retry-After`."

#: ../../errors.md:88
msgid ""
"Wait for the number of seconds in `Retry-After`, then send the request "
"again. Retrying straight away only uses up more of your allowance."
msgstr ""
"Linda inani lamasekhondi eliku-`Retry-After`, bese uthumela isicelo futhi. "
"Ukuzama futhi ngokushesha kumane kusebenzise enye ingxenye yesabelo sakho."

#: ../../errors.md:90
msgid ""
"If you see `429` often, slow your requests down. Watch `X-RateLimit-"
"Remaining` and pause before it reaches zero."
msgstr ""
"Uma uvame ukubona `429`, yehlisa ijubane lezicelo zakho. Bheka "
"`X-RateLimit-Remaining` futhi ume kancane ngaphambi kokuba ifinyelele ku-zero."

#: ../../errors.md:92
msgid "What to retry"
msgstr "Okufanele uzame futhi"

#: ../../errors.md:94
msgid ""
"Retry `429` after the `Retry-After` delay. Retry `500` and network "
"failures with exponential backoff, which means waiting a little longer "
"after each failed attempt. Never retry the other errors."
msgstr ""
"Zama futhi `429` ngemva kwesikhathi esishiwo yi-`Retry-After`. Zama futhi "
"`500` namaphutha enethiwekhi ngokulinda isikhathi esikhulayo, okusho ukulinda "
"isikhathi eside kancane ngemva komzamo ngamunye ohlulekile. Ungalokothi "
"uzame futhi amanye amaphutha."

#: ../../errors.md:96
msgid ""
"The [production checklist](production.md) includes a client that does all"
" of this."
msgstr ""
"I-[production checklist](production.md) iqukethe i-client eyenza konke lokhu."